  "heading": "\\vector.space:over{F}",
  "heading_latex": "\\textrm{vector space over }F",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\vector.space:over{F}]\nDeclares: V ::= (X, +, *, 0) is \\set via X\nwhen: F is \\field\nspecifies:\n. + is \\(associative, commutative)::binary.operation:on{X}\n. * is \\function:on{F \\.set.cross./ X}:to{X}\n. 0 \"in\" X\nsatisfies:\n. [additive.identity]\n  forAll: v \"in\" X\n  then: v + 0 = v\n. [additive.inverse]\n  forAll: v \"in\" X\n  then:\n  . exists: w \"in\" X\n    suchThat: v + w = 0\n. [scalar.distributivity.vector]\n  forAll: c \"in\" F\n  then:\n  . forAll: u, v \"in\" X\n    then: c * (u + v) = (c * u) + (c * v)\n. [scalar.distributivity.field]\n  forAll: a, b \"in\" F\n  then:\n  . forAll: v \"in\" X\n    then: (a + b) * v = (a * v) + (b * v)\n. [scalar.associativity]\n  forAll: a, b \"in\" F\n  then:\n  . forAll: v \"in\" X\n    then: (a * b) * v = a * (b * v)\n. [scalar.identity]\n  forAll: v \"in\" X\n  then: 1 * v = v\nEnables:\n. capability: v_ \"in\" V :<->: v_ is \\vector:in{V}\n  written: \"v_? \\in V?\"\nDocumented:\n. called: \"vector space over $F?$\"\n. description: \"A vector space $(V, +, *, 0)$ over a field $F$ is an abelian\n                group under addition equipped with scalar multiplication by $F$.\"\nId: \"6c32eba5-b1fe-456d-84db-058653584067\"",
